      "meta": {
        "type": "skill",
        "skill": "listening",
        "text": "🎧 <b>IELTS LISTENING | 1 MINUTE HACK</b>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n⚠️ <b>Qo'shma so'zlar tuzog'i:</b>\nSpiker ikkita alohida so'zni urg'u bilan aytib, sizni ikkita bo'sh joy bor deb o'ylatadi. Masalan: <i>\"We need a new bicycle rack\"</i> o'rniga <i>\"bicycle... rack\"</i> deb to'xtalishi mumkin, siz esa buni <i>bicycle track</i> deb yozib adashasiz.\n\n💡 <b>Oltin qoida:</b>\nMatn ma'nosiga qarang. Agar u bitta buyumni bildirsa, so'zlarni qo'shib yozing: <i>\"The library offers a great <b>study room</b> for students.\"</i>\n\n💡 <i>IELTSga tayyorlanayotgan do'stlaringizga ham ulashing!</i>\n\n👉 Telegram: @dilshod_english\n📸 Instagram: instagram.com/dilshod.ustoz"
      },
